Per-module tracing gates, and the library whose preprocessor_deps declares each:
  OCANNL_LOG_LEVEL_ASSIGNMENTS   arrayjit/lib/dune, library ir (arrayjit/lib/assignments.ml)
  OCANNL_LOG_LEVEL_BACKENDS      arrayjit/lib/dune, library context (arrayjit/lib/backends.ml)
